or":"24292f","fallback":"denodev/deno_vscode_languageserver","id":1,"title":"denodev/deno_vscode_languageserver","text":"Language server protocol implementation for VSCode. This allows implementing language services in JS/TS running on Deno.","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"10","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"TypeScript","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1632463308.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9/b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa7ad6dc-d2ea-4888-bbd8-dc587ac3a709","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"LS 作った。動作確認するの何にしようか → とりあえずユーザー多い VSCode でいいか(エコシステム揃ってるし)\nが多いと思ってます。","ts":"1632463019.140000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5UD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43fcf573-2549-4d98-bac6-0cf6f0dafdd1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"だから私としては他のクライアントを応援したいのですよね","ts":"1632462970.139200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CjX2s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"232f6d2a-7e03-4c0b-b5de-664779d0664c","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"他のLSクライアントのことは気にしてないですね。気にしてるのはVSCodeです","ts":"1632462961.138800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8HZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a6b6687-4ffd-47c9-bef0-65d70c08c7ec","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"もうすでになってる気がする。","ts":"1632462946.138300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uUq+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"257c0b45-8068-45f3-8fbc-4c085fccfc5d","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"はい。coc は VSCode だと思ってもらって問題ないです。","ts":"1632462941.138100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ai1Ar"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a18e317a-c996-468b-8df5-4ee06efd43af","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"LSPイコールVSCodeとなる危機感","ts":"1632462924.137800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"68Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49ee5b5a-062e-48a5-9b74-2949ae773505","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"VSCodeの動きに忠実なので、そちらが標準になってしまうのはなんかまずいような予感がしてる","ts":"1632462895.137200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j3Dw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7f16463-b141-4898-9365-731fb77b0b36","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"cocはLSPの仕様に忠実というより","ts":"1632462866.136300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w+Cl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f94329cd-5c02-4f78-bb17-5c8a1b050c0e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"denops 製の lsp クライアントの流れ…?","ts":"1632462859.136000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5cdMq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ded7b04-67fd-446d-816b-8976251f4eef","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"Neovim の builtin の LSP も正式リリースされたので更に選択肢が増えてる状況ですしね","ts":"1632462822.135500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UNHl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bdf4c92-714d-48d9-840f-c4d25bba76a7","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"うーん、どうですかね。 lambdalisue さんや Shougo さんの denops の取り組みで流れてる人も多いと思います。日本人は Shougo さんの事、だいたいの方は大好きですしね","ts":"1632462765.134500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e5AL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d44706e0-1433-45ea-8af4-5c570b9b876c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"つい最近まではcoc最強だったのに流れが変わるのは早いもの","ts":"1632462659.134300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vg4Kz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86c7db9f-817a-499b-b3e3-6d6c8db632ae","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"はい。coc もいつなくなるかわからないですからね。","ts":"1632462642.133700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5wd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1369516c-9858-4f8a-8e87-a1b9443985d8","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"選択肢があるのはよいことだと思いますね","ts":"1632462602.133000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s0O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c929a772-4278-485b-ad28-324ca3f92cb3","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"他のだと、今はできてても、LSの更新のタイミングなどで追従するのが coc に比べるとツラミが出てるものもあるかもってくらいでしょうか。すべてよしなにLS側だけでやってくれないものもあるので。","ts":"1632462517.132300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Qs7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4fcb8794-a300-4e5a-8611-ed9cab4032ff","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"coc で固めればトラブルは少ないと思いますし、 LS や VSCodeの拡張の更新にもしっかり追従しやすい仕組みなのでそれは強みですね。VSCodeユーザーと同じ言葉で話もしやすいかも。","ts":"1632462392.132000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oPM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c0e7d97-2ec6-4669-9d0d-ec69c377490b","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"個人的にはddc-cocが出たら多分トンボ返りするかもです……","ts":"1632462195.131500","thread_ts":"1632462195.131500","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e2K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3fc6256-9607-4510-9028-981263ec4426","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"coc.nvim は coc.nvim で魅力はありますが、他も自由度や、単純に関連のプロダクトが楽しい、好きみたいなのもあると思うので。皆さん好きなのを使うと良いと思います。","ts":"1632462188.131200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":3,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U7JL1UKKL","U8R597E9H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"41K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7449680-e0ab-4104-b7c8-0309f3b9b635","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"(でも、聞くと本家にPRしてくれたら嬉しいみたいなパターンの流れもあるかも) ※結果オーライですが","ts":"1632462113.129900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nykw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24f7de94-ca4b-401c-a92d-64a1d780b95e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"脱cocの流れになってる?w","ts":"1632462107.129700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"crth"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8121a7a0-a2a3-4574-8721-9d2f1c109e74","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"作者さんにその issue で聞いてみたら良いのではないでしょうか","ts":"1632462013.129200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LVsb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46f0f064-475f-4d09-a0a9-cad0e66a7ff8","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"本家は似たようなissueあったんですが出してくれなさそうなので、forkしてlspのバイナリだけリリースする、とか(Licence的には)いいんですかね？","ts":"1632461876.128100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aNu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a72a16e-5b9d-47a3-8f76-904de4170a3b","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"denops がわいわい楽しそうなので、それは仕方ない","ts":"1632461871.127900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/w2O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc6c753d-c03b-4bd8-82f4-d88d584c2421","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"cocユーザ減っていってる？","ts":"1632461846.126900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4vMhb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc5542e0-2970-428e-8ad8-40067926d332","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あとは、やはり、 taplo-lsp のバイナリリリースがあると良いですね","ts":"1632461778.125500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IVE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74a1a264-70af-41ec-8b6d-0ed1f904b4fa","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ついに kkiyama117  さん、脱 coc ってことですかね","ts":"1632461729.125200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"bow","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v8oA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24f4f2d1-30a1-403e-8ff7-e5bf578ff82d","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"initializeOptionはそのままでworkspace_configをevenBetterTomlで囲ったら設定反映されて無事補完まで動きました\n助けてくださった皆様ありがとうございました。vim-lsp-settingsにプルリクエスト投げたいと思います。","ts":"1632461570.124700","thread_ts":"1632461570.124700","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ERK="}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffcff0f3-0b3b-4954-8985-38da8b644f67","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"なるほど","ts":"1632460070.120300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"do9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"028b8283-9f43-413f-b20b-aa4d1bafdae0","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"サーバもクライアントも valid な挙動をしていると思います。この件については。","ts":"1632460047.120100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oWA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3e74d67-90b4-4b87-a2e2-cd1d7f7c3c81","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"initializationOptions は特に命名規則とかないんじゃないですかね。any のようなのでなんでもよさそうです。LSに設定さえ渡せれば","ts":"1632459973.119400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eiwh="}]},{"client_msg_id":"09119e6e-9eb5-4a3c-b271-a05f0d743bc1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"なんか、LSの実装として、仕様通りなのか気になりますね","ts":"1632459801.118600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pjf8Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35929b90-088e-4e86-9f3f-50b733041262","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"そうですね。 だいたいの LS は initializationOptions はフラットな感じの設定ですが、例えば vue2 用の vetur も config ってキーで括ってたりみたいなパターンがあるので。taplo は \"configuration\" で括る感じっぽいですね\n\n```    \"initializationOptions\": {\n        \"config\": {\n            \"editor\": {\n                \"tabSize\": 4,\n                \"insertSpaces\": true,\n          // ...snip\n        },\n    },```","ts":"1632459703.118200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XDjKR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93bcafb9-ede6-4db6-ba5d-a59c1aabe719","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```let s:initial_configuration = {\n\\   ...\n\\ }\n\ncall lsp#register_server({\n\\   'name': 'taplo',\n\\   'initialization_options': { 'configuration': s:initial_configuration },\n\\.  'workspace_config': { 'evenBetterToml': s:initial_configuration },\n\\ })```\nイメージとしてはこういう感じかと。","ts":"1632459551.117800","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1632459564.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Tp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d00bd335-9319-4d48-af74-43f09d2de14f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"おそらく、workspace configuration をベースにして初期設定をしてあげるのがいいんだと思います。","ts":"1632459359.116200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AkoHN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb178367-b2d3-45f1-98ad-ae72d4867938","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ただ VSCode の拡張だと Rust 製の taplo-lsp のコマンドじゃなくて JS で吐き出した npm にあるパッケージのやつを起動してるのでよくわからない(同様の渡し方で良いのかなど)","ts":"1632458837.115700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z=j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4570f9b0-fc3c-4a5d-940b-0f0492018dd2","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"とりあえず Even Better TOML (taplo の VSCode用のエクステンション) で `trace` したところ、 initializationOptions が \"configuration\" の キーで囲まれてることがわかりました。\n```    \"initializationOptions\": {\n        \"configuration\": {\n            \"activationStatus\": true,\n            \"taploConfig\": \"\",\n            \"commands\": {\n                \"copyTomlAsJson\": true,\n                \"copyJsonAsToml\": true,\n                \"pasteJsonAsToml\": true,\n                \"pasteTomlAsJson\": true,\n                \"clearCache\": false,\n                \"downloadSchemas\": false\n            },\n// ..snip\n            \"debug\": false,\n            \"trace\": {\n                \"server\": \"verbose\"\n            }\n        }\n    },```","ts":"1632458599.115300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SlVn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b4b761b-aebe-4af3-a5e0-59b9982a1ddc","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"kkiyama117 さん自身が taplo 自体を調整してPR出さないと進展しなそうな雰囲気感ですね...","ts":"1632457347.115000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"biu+C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"020d15fd-f0d8-4587-83c8-ff0883b60c92","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"この issue ってことですね \u003chttps://github.com/tamasfe/taplo/issues/167\u003e","ts":"1632457294.114600","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/tamasfe/taplo/issues/167|#167 [lsp] Add support for didChangeConfiguration\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/tamasfe/taplo/issues/167|#167 [lsp] Add support for didChangeConfiguration\u003e","text":"When using `taplo-lsp` as a client application and when lsp client notifies `workspace/configuration`, the configuration state in taplo-lsp always turns out to be None. I tried to implement to get values like \u003chttps://github.com/kkiyama117/taplo/commit/a8adc704238d2a7b0f3521254e1f929e4efbc01f|this\u003e, and it works, but I'm not sure that this implementation is correct and not bad for the evenBetterToml (vscode) version, so I'd like to hear your opinion.","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"3","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/tamasfe/taplo|tamasfe/taplo\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1632003402}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e+B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d14cc36-2505-4e2c-9e08-b9b204d29cbb","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"workspace/configuration は workspace_config の値が返るので問題ないです。","ts":"1632456899.114100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4sAXq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"863c3e5e-c1b9-4d48-898a-bab56f9aa205","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"vim-lsp-settingsの他のlspを参考にしてinitializeとworkspace/didChangeConfigrationでは同じ値が渡るように設定したのですが、workspace/configurationは渡す値は現状設定出来ない感じでしょうか？","ts":"1632456508.113500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sYl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08496cc0-d6db-420e-916f-c4a99bd027fa","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そのとおりだと思います。つまり、言語サーバの要求するセットアップを行えばよいということですね。\nvim-lsp-settings の workspace_config を適切に設定して、それと同じ値が initialization_options に渡るように設定を改善すればうまくいきそうです。","ts":"1632456261.109500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yBf"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U011WJ8K6UU","text":"\u003c@U011WJ8K6UU\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1632456197.108400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"dad714af-b78d-481a-ac93-3f65e417e2aa","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"vscodeだと \u003c@U8R597E9H\u003eさんが仰るようにworkspace/configurationの値がよしなに与えられてるみたいで作者さんには「initializeと全く同じ引数与えるなら何の問題もないよね？」みたいな感じの事言われてしまいました","ts":"1632456164.108200","edited":{"user":"U01BY3SDBRS","ts":"1632456536.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hhD7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7edd2c0f-69ef-4169-9942-d6855942b2b0","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"皆さんありがとうございます\n作者さんとしてはrust-analyzerを参考にしているようなんですが、\ndidChangeConfigurationが通知されたらその値とworkspace/configrationは同期されているはずなので後者を要求してそちらの値を評価する(前者の引数の方は評価しない)、という仕様になっているようです。\n問題はこの値とinitializeOptionがどちらもtaplo内部の設定用の同じ変数に影響を与えてしまう所です","ts":"1632456023.104600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bvggY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90db97c8-6663-4922-a5f5-19913f425733","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"vim-lsp で、initialization_options に設定を与えて、workspace_settings に設定を与えていない場合、それは taplo サーバ的には予期しない状況になっているようです。","ts":"1632452989.093700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pnupZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ff38d77-d50e-484f-8b52-2c86bab556c2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"1. taplo の VSCode 拡張は initializationOptions に workspace 設定を渡すようになっている\n→ つまり、initializationOptions は必ず workspace 設定と同期されているという考えになっている\n1. VSCode の場合、workspace 設定は package.json の json-schema からデフォルト値が設定される\n→ つまり、ユーザは設定しなくてもいい感じのデフォルト値が勝手に与えられる","ts":"1632452961.093100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"058ql"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3485ee8f-d240-4ae9-9767-5fa1f70aafbb","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"なんとなく、こうかな？というのがわかりました。","ts":"1632452859.091000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NoFZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2a97bba-fccf-48d3-a5db-63b729b5259d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"自分も \u003c@UAZ33BKV2\u003e さんの言うように、vim-lsp の挙動は問題がないように思えました。\nが、taplo language-server もまた VSCode でテストされているはずなのでちょっと気になりますね。時間がかかるかもですが見ては見ます。","ts":"1632449500.090700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LhajR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7378ffc-f812-44b2-87c4-e49d953aec33","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、通知で応答不要なんですね。\nえっとtaploで\n\u0026gt; 具体的にはvim-lspとの組み合わせなんですが、 `workspace/didChangeConfiguration` が送られると値をガン無視して `workspace/configuration` を要求→vim-lspがnullを返す-\u0026gt;内部で保持するConfig(initializeのoptionと同じ)をNoneで上書きする、\nだそうで、workspace/configurationを要求する必要はないし、その要求の項目的にnull返すしかなさそうだし、その結果で設定をNoneにしちゃうのもまずいよね、みたいな動きのようです。","ts":"1632447385.089700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nT5DN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d580212c-f07a-43fc-9173-97a277ee9a4d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"すみません。この話もう少し教えて貰えますか。didChangeConfiguration って通知なので応答不要じゃなかったでしたっけ。","ts":"1632445610.088100","thread_ts":"1632298295.061500","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g+/3U"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"f086c342-b22b-48ac-9b15-f1429b92643b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いまちょっと全部見れないので、できれば \u003c@U8R597E9H\u003e さんとか \u003c@U03C6TEAZ\u003e さんに確認したいな","ts":"1632298295.061500","thread_ts":"1632298295.061500","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e+B"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"36e3f81d-07bf-43da-a86a-5d54e2f0ba7d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"リポジトリに破壊的変更があったんだと思います","ts":"1632465534.149800","thread_ts":"1632465152.145100","parent_user_id":"U06ECBRTJ","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bgOE4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42cb0b5e-99b2-4e24-a456-f39e4bf6381f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"dein#reinstallでなおりますよ","ts":"1632465546.150000","thread_ts":"1632465152.145100","parent_user_id":"U06ECBRTJ","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FWvq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c783e066-1ca8-4cf1-9406-8d48f4b99d42","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"reinstall便利機能なのに他のプラグインマネージャーでは見たことないなと思ったりします","ts":"1632465569.150200","thread_ts":"1632465152.145100","parent_user_id":"U06ECBRTJ","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ch0O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d57ece58-c6d0-4965-a325-7b50a659fb41","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"なるほど、ありがとうございます。","ts":"1632466058.150600","thread_ts":"1632465152.145100","parent_user_id":"U06ECBRTJ","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EKkC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f76e3a70-829b-4412-86ce-38372f0fb5ef","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"オッ","ts":"1632462615.133100","thread_ts":"1632462195.131500","parent_user_id":"U01BY3SDBRS","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8PmvZ"}]}]
